Package: batonutil
Type: Package
Title: Utilities for Fitting and Tracking a Repline-level Prepayment Model
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Date: 2016-12-05
Authors@R: person("Chaudhary", "Sharad", email="sharad.chaudhary@PIVcapital.com",
  role=c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Import, tidy and transform a prepayment data set in preparation
    for modeling. Estimate the relevant submodel (curtailment, default, refinancing,
    turnover) depending on the user's preference (different input files are required
    for curtailment and default data). The model is calibrated using an iterative
    scheme and tracking results are output.
